# News Article Classification (RF + TF-IDF, BiLSTM, DistilBERT)

## Backend
```bash
cd backend && pip install -r requirements.txt
mkdir -p data models        # put news.csv (columns: text,label; 6 classes) in data/
python train_rf.py
python train_lstm.py
python train_bert.py
export JWT_SECRET_KEY="a-long-random-string"
python app.py               # http://localhost:5000
```
## Frontend
```bash
cd frontend && npm install && npm run dev
```
## API
POST /api/register, /api/login | GET /api/models, /api/history, /api/analytics | POST /api/predict {text, model: rf|lstm|bert}
